388	     * customerCode} (its prefix up to the first {@code '-'}), which is the region derived from
389	     * the owner's postcode at creation ({@link #UNKNOWN_REGION} when the postcode maps to no
390	     * known region). Locality is read from the region-and-hash identity so it never re-derives
391	     * a region of its own; it is {@link #UNKNOWN_REGION} for an owner that has no customerCode.
