421	     * when the postcode is absent, not four digits, or in no known range. This is the {@code <REGION>}
422	     * component built into the owner's customer code at creation and, through it, the source of the
423	     * owner's {@linkplain #getLocality() locality}. It is the single place a region is read from an
424	     * owner's postcode, so every rule keyed by the postcode-derived region shares one derivation.
